    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "Maths feels like a bridge between abstract concepts and real-world logic for me—something I find both challenging and rewarding. My parents didn’t have formal education, so math was my way of proving I could navigate complexity independently. Though intimidated early on, it’s become a tool for problem-solving in photography (calculating exposure) and cooking (converting recipes).",
