    "Did you ever use AI to support your math learning in the last year? If yes, how was your experience?": "No, but I’d love to try! With my neuroticism and low extraversion, tools like step-by-step calculators or chatbots could reduce anxiety by offering structured guidance. My relationship with math is tied to feeling supported—AI might help me see patterns more clearly without pressure.",
